        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "ZjhTx",
          "x": 40,
          "y": 858,
          "name": "Material Notes",
          "width": 920,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 4,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "C9i28p",
              "name": "Text",
              "fill": "#ffffff",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• 材質：硬糖亮面（hard candy）。徑向漸層 亮→本色→暗（0 / 42% / 100%），光源左上 36%,30%。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "TQqoP",
              "name": "Text",
              "fill": "#ffffff",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• 邊緣：內陰影 y-4 blur6 暗色 67%＋頂緣白 1px 內光；外陰影 y+3 blur4 #1a0b3c 53%。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "FS4h2",
              "name": "Text",
              "fill": "#ffffff",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• 高光：左上橢圓白 95% 羽化＋1 顆 4px 硬白點（鏡面反射），是『糖』感的關鍵。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "FVQ9B",
              "name": "Text",
              "fill": "#ffffff",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• UI：糖果按鈕＝漸層＋白 3px 外框＋底部 5px 實色落影（按下時落影歸零、下移 3px）。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
